// txCanonicalRuler, and what only it reaches
//
// The template of a ruler (paragraph format) as the text view (clTXView)
// hands one to scripts: justification, indent, margins, line spacing and
// tabs (src/text/TXRuler.cpp clones it).

txCanonicalRuler := {justification: nil, indent: nil, leftMargin: nil, rightMargin: nil, lineSpacing: nil, tabs: nil};
